  "id": "repertory-grid",
  "term": "repertory grid",
  "definition": "A repertory grid is an assessment method from personal construct theory used to explore a person’s conceptual structure, including how they understand themselves, other people, and the world. In psychology, it is used to examine how someone construes or makes sense of experience.",
